5. **Describe the behaviour on approaching any vertical asymptotes and as $x \to \pm\infty$**
As $x \to -\infty$, $y \to 0^{-}$, so $y = 0$ is a horizontal asymptote on the left; as $x \to \infty$, $y \to \infty$.
